  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILGA is a LGBTI member organsation currently 800 member               organisations. Gained ECOSOC status in 2011. The vision is that of a  world where human rights are respected and everyone can live in       equality and freedom regardless sexual orientation. The Hq is based i Brussels. Sida supports ILGA with corefunding from 2011. Prioriyareas are lesbian womens situation and to streghten organisations in Africa</narrative>
